---
title: fork_trigger (Fulu Fork Specification)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_slot : state.slot % SLOTS_PER_EPOCH == 0
    q_check_slot --> q_check_epoch : true
    q_check_slot --> [*] : false
    q_check_epoch --> q_upgrade : compute_epoch_at_slot(state.slot) == FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    q_check_epoch --> [*] : compute_epoch_at_slot(state.slot) != FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    q_upgrade --> [*] : upgrade_to_fulu(state)

    note right of q_check_slot
        INV: Fork trigger only fires once at exactly FULU_FORK_EPOCH
    end note
    note right of q_check_epoch
        INV: Fork trigger requires slot to be first slot of an epoch
    end note
